  "details": "I want to discuss the potential for either eliminating or adding a toggle for the \"avatar texture optimization\" feature in VRChat. This feature can be quite discouraging for new players, as it detracts from the visual enjoyment of the game during their initial experience. It would be better as an optional feature, since it appears to exacerbate optimization and crashing problems instead of resolving them. I strongly encourage you to rethink this important change that affects the overall gaming experience. Below, I’ve included an image showcasing the impact of these changes using an Eevee as an example, which is something new players—and even returning ones—might frequently encounter.",
